== Trivia ==
* Telekinesis is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=857187975 this Steam Workshop item] by Eufuu, originally known as Telepathy.
* This item and the pickup sprite may be a reference to [[wikipedia:The Matrix|The Matrix]], where the protagonist [[wikipedia:Neo (The Matrix)|Neo]] can stop bullets in mid-air when they are directly in front of him, holding out his right hand exactly how it's represented in the sprite.

